    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="6.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVEg">IV Eg</ref> 6.2</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="6.2" corresp="#wit-f">⁊ swa geǽþdera manna sýn on ælcum ceape twegen oððe þry to gewitnysse.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="6.2" corresp="#wit-c">⁊ swa geæðedra manna syn on ælcum ceape twegen oððe þry to gewitnysse.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="6.2" corresp="#wit-q">Sintquę duo electorum uirorum in quolibet negotio procuratores positi, ut sciant, quid quisque dat et quid recipit.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" n="6.2" corresp="#wit-c">⁊ swa geæðedra manna syn on ælcum ceape twegen oððe þry to gewitnysse.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-c">And two or three men who have taken the oath in this manner shall be present as witnesses at every transaction.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Und so vereideter Männer seien bei jedem Kaufgeschäft zwei oder drei als Zeugenschaft.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">And let there be two or three of such sworn men as witnesses at every transaction.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
